\f0\fs24 \cf0 README\
\
The folder contains 5 .csv files based on the Seville dataset (blender model of 1m x 1m grid) and 2 .png files describing the relevant statistics of the Seville dataset which is made up of 5000 triangles resembling blades of grass or \'93objects\'94. \
\
Density_objects_dm, Height_dm, Intensity_0-255 are values for a 50 x 50 grid.\
\
 The density is measured in objects/dm^2. The height is measured in dm and the intensity is measured in 8-bit integers. Each object is a triangle with 0.1 dm base and a height. \
\
The probability distribution of the orientation (in deg) of the base is in Orientation_probability_density.csv. Similarly, the probability distribution of elevation (in deg) of the objects is in Elevation_probability_density.csv.}